      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Organizational Unit\n\nA recognized internal component of an organization.\n\n## Required fields\n\n- `name`\n- `unitType`\n- `parentOrganizationRef`\n\n## Modeling boundary\n\nKeep provenance in connected Claim → Evidence → Source nodes rather than embedded source arrays.",
